{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほねほね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この服かわい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっとんでしまいたい。\nもっとなんか、できたらいいなあ。\nできる勇気とセンスがほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、今日も稽古でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐっちゃぐっちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーティラミスフラペチーノ\n飲みたーい。\n明日朝早ーい。\nでも頑張るぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツシンプルでいいね\n白だからあわせやすいし\nまりっかならどんな\nコーディネートする？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーイフレンドデニムとか\nショーパンとかシンプルに\n着たいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このデザイン画は、\nいつ書いたのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムの\nMV撮影の休憩中に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は浴衣で花火大会\n行きたいと思うんだけど、\n何色何柄がいいかな？あ、男用で！\nまりかは好きな柄はございますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーいいねえ。お祭りいいねえ。\n男用ってまず何色何柄があるか\nわからない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、シンプルなのが良いなあ。\n自分が着たいのは\nモダンレトロな柄かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セリフ覚えるのは得意ですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸張って得意！とは言えないけど\n楽しいから自然と覚えられる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは目覚めは良い方??\nまた何か良いお目覚め方法ある??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は悪いです...不健康なんです。\nゆっくりお風呂に浸かって\n早く寝るのがいちばんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の片付けとか得意？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意だよー部屋はきれいな方が\n気持ちもすっきりするからねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ頃から絵好きなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっさい頃から絵ばっかり\n描いてたよ。かなり恥ずかしいが\n自作の漫画とかも描いてたよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育祭の思い出とかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中3の頃の体育祭かな。\n団それぞれの大きいポスター？絵？を\n放課後残って描いてました...\n緑団だったから蛇。\n超力作だったんだけど選ばれなくて\nめっちゃ泣いたなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここが\nどんどん配信されておるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどんMCがマシになってきたぞー\nぜひ見てくださいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n今日はBADBOYS J第4話が\n放送されます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよナイツレディースが\n動き出すぞ。\nななみとさゆりんと伊藤ちゃんずの\n絡みに注目だー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るしか見るしかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/27/7306068/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではBBJ見てから、おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}